(*!
<summary>Marker interface representing an embedded condition reset scope node.</summary>
<description>
Scopes are linked in an ownership tree to restore variable state during condition resets.
Instances are non-copyable, owned by an activity or condition, and managed within a single task.
</description>
*)
{attribute 'hide'}
INTERFACE IVariableResetScope EXTENDS TOF_Core.IObject
]]></Declaration>
  </Itf>
</TcPlcObject>
